<h1>Hyperlinks Example</h1>
<!-- Text link -->
<p>
Visit our official website:
<a href="https://www.aec.edu.in/" target="_blank">AEC Website</a>
</p>
<!-- Image link -->
<p>
Click the image to see our gallery:
<a href="https://www.aec.edu.in/?p=Gallery" target="_blank">
<img src="https://www.aec.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/logo.png"
alt="AEC Gallery"
width="200">
</a>
</p>
<p>Explanation:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>href</strong>: Specifies the URL of the page to link to.</li>
<li><strong>target="_blank"</strong>: Opens the link in a new tab/window.</li>
<li>You can use text or an image inside the <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> tag to create a clickable link.</li>
</ul>
</body>
